[[:db/retract 17592186117493 :answer-field/choices 17592186117494] [:db/retract 17592186117493 :answer-field/choices 17592186117495] [:db/retract 17592186117493 :answer-field/choices 17592186117496] [:db/retract 17592186117493 :answer-field/choices 17592186117497] [:db/retract 17592186117493 :answer-field/choices 17592186117498] {:db/id 17592186120222 :question/problem "Find an equation of the plane that contains the point $P(\\sqrt{2},3,4)$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n=2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=\\sqrt{2}i+3j+4k,$ and $n=2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k$ is normal to the plane.\n\nThe equation of the plane that passes through the point $P({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n$ can be given as\n\n$$\n(r-p)\\cdot n=0,\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is the position vector of any point on the plane, and $p$ is the position vector of $P.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-p\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot (2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k) & =(\\sqrt{2}i+3j+4k)\\cdot (2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k) \\\\ r\\cdot (2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k) & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186117493 :answer-field/correct "answer-26e81e0f-00be-5150-9e74-fec4066ead13" :answer-field/choices ["answer-eead13a6-edac-5ccb-bd23-f3ae56dce20e" "answer-26e81e0f-00be-5150-9e74-fec4066ead13" "answer-d8a2f39f-065a-5b9a-9af2-2369637cc071" "answer-24bd5c51-ea5f-55c2-b7cc-0a1c6fdaf3e9" "answer-1490998e-fd96-558a-92bf-90c3e1b1d823"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eead13a6-edac-5ccb-bd23-f3ae56dce20e" :answer/id #uuid "eead13a6-edac-5ccb-bd23-f3ae56dce20e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r\\cdot (2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k)=-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-26e81e0f-00be-5150-9e74-fec4066ead13" :answer/id #uuid "26e81e0f-00be-5150-9e74-fec4066ead13" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r\\cdot (2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k)=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d8a2f39f-065a-5b9a-9af2-2369637cc071" :answer/id #uuid "d8a2f39f-065a-5b9a-9af2-2369637cc071" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r\\cdot (2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k)=5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-24bd5c51-ea5f-55c2-b7cc-0a1c6fdaf3e9" :answer/id #uuid "24bd5c51-ea5f-55c2-b7cc-0a1c6fdaf3e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r\\cdot (2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k)=\\sqrt{2}i+3j+4k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1490998e-fd96-558a-92bf-90c3e1b1d823" :answer/id #uuid "1490998e-fd96-558a-92bf-90c3e1b1d823" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r\\cdot (\\sqrt{2}i+3j+4k)=2\\sqrt{2}i+7j-6k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-b4a03ddd-003b-5e8e-82c8-2cc43b396522" :activity/id #uuid "b4a03ddd-003b-5e8e-82c8-2cc43b396522" :activity/title "The Vector Equation of a Plane" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049436 :activity/course 17592186046658 :activity/steps ["step-ad4d6328-8534-5210-8c4a-365882fe2824" "step-9462b507-c0a1-5898-9afa-bb4186df83ec" "step-3458e62b-8854-5734-859a-ce2619927743" "step-fb8f9fe8-2ed4-5d86-8099-75a35919ccad" "step-735f1d1f-3dd1-50b8-8d7c-9fcb22c5b1c7"] :activity/first-step "step-ad4d6328-8534-5210-8c4a-365882fe2824" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-ad4d6328-8534-5210-8c4a-365882fe2824" :step/id #uuid "ad4d6328-8534-5210-8c4a-365882fe2824" :step/content 17592186120222 :step/next "step-9462b507-c0a1-5898-9afa-bb4186df83ec" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-9462b507-c0a1-5898-9afa-bb4186df83ec" :step/id #uuid "9462b507-c0a1-5898-9afa-bb4186df83ec" :step/content 17592186338827 :step/next "step-3458e62b-8854-5734-859a-ce2619927743" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-3458e62b-8854-5734-859a-ce2619927743" :step/id #uuid "3458e62b-8854-5734-859a-ce2619927743" :step/content 17592186420153 :step/next "step-fb8f9fe8-2ed4-5d86-8099-75a35919ccad" :db/ensur